{"id":"d6dc5974baa6f8a5","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-recursive.md","title":"可计算集合","display":"df-recursive — 可计算集合","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-recursive","aliases":["20-df-recursive"],"display":"df-recursive — 可计算集合","chapter":"17","section":"17.2","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"reviewed","source_reference":"Definition 17.2.2；Notation","source_pdf_pages":[257],"source_printed_pages":[230],"depends_on":["[[20-df-computable]]","[[20-df-characteristic]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-recursive"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-recursive</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-recursive — 可计算集合"},{"key":"chapter","html":"17"},{"key":"section","html":"17.2"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Definition 17.2.2；Notation"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>257</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>230</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"de14d8d6c42250de\" href=\"?note=de14d8d6c42250de\" title=\"20-df-characteristic\">20-df-characteristic</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(A\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_A:\\omega\\to2\">\\(\\chi_A:\\omega\\to2\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"de14d8d6c42250de\" href=\"?note=de14d8d6c42250de\" title=\"20-df-characteristic\">20-df-characteristic</a>。</p>\n<p>上标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{tot}\">\\(\\mathrm{tot}\\)</span> 表示全定义限制：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C_k^{\\mathrm{tot}}=\\{f\\in\\mathcal C_k:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^k\\}\">\\(\\mathcal C_k^{\\mathrm{tot}}=\\{f\\in\\mathcal C_k:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^k\\}\\)</span>；相对族采用同一限制。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}recursive}\\vdash\n\\mathcal R:=\\{A\\subseteq\\omega:\\chi_A\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\},\\qquad\n\\mathrm R:=\\mathcal R.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}recursive}\\vdash\n\\mathcal R:=\\{A\\subseteq\\omega:\\chi_A\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\},\\qquad\n\\mathrm R:=\\mathcal R.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>多元可计算关系通过配对编码处理。这里“recursive set”与“computable set”同义，采用本书建议的后者。此定义不依赖停机集，避免旧的集合定义与停机集回环。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 17.2.2；Notation；印刷页 230；PDF 第 257 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-characteristic","status":"resolved","id":"de14d8d6c42250de","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-characteristic]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-computable]]；see [[20-df-characteristic]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-characteristic","status":"resolved","id":"de14d8d6c42250de","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-computable]]；see [[20-df-characteristic]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi_A:\\omega\\to2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{tot}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C_k^{\\mathrm{tot}}=\\{f\\in\\mathcal C_k:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^k\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}recursive}\\vdash\n\\mathcal R:=\\{A\\subseteq\\omega:\\chi_A\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\},\\qquad\n\\mathrm R:=\\mathcal R.","display":true}],"bytes":1272,"backlinks":[{"id":"832f53dc90c8947a","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-recursive]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]。"},{"id":"1425fc4773bfa69c","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-numbering]]；see [[20-df-recursive]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]。"},{"id":"cfaaad5ff3481d99","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-recursive]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]。"},{"id":"481242259f6605e4","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-re]]；see [[20-df-recursive]]。"},{"id":"9f5c300501e65ad4","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-re]]；see [[20-df-recursive]]。"},{"id":"02d13ca813f4498f","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-mred]]；see [[20-df-recursive]]。"},{"id":"2303910615f024a0","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"e